@startuml
title Current backend | Booking and asynchronous settlement | FR-007/009
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
actor "API caller" as U
participant Gateway as G
participant "Live Class use cases" as C
database "live_class schema" as D
participant "Shared outbox relay" as E
queue RabbitMQ as Q
participant "Wallet consumer / use case" as W
database "wallet_ledger schema" as WD
U -> G: POST /api/classes/:id/bookings\nJWT + idempotencyKey
G -> C: Validated JWT; trusted identity; HTTP proxy
C -> D: Replay lookup; class read; seat guard under row lock
alt ineligible / duplicate / full
 C --> U: Reject; no wallet debit
else eligible
 C -> D: Pending booking; price snapshot; 15-minute expiry
 C --> U: Pending booking
end
U -> G: POST /api/classes/bookings/:bookingId/confirm
G -> C: ConfirmBookingUseCase
C -> D: Own transaction: Confirmed\n+ booking.confirmed outbox
C --> U: Confirmation response BEFORE wallet settlement
E -> D: Poll committed outbox
E -> Q: booking.confirmed
Q -> W: Idempotent consumer
W -> WD: Own transaction: debit Learner available\nTeacher pending + platform fee floor(credits * 1000/10000)
alt insufficient balance / consumer error
 W --> Q: Retry; eventual DLQ
 note over C,WD
 Current code has no compensating confirmation acknowledgement here.
 AC-005 no-partial-paid-booking guarantee is not demonstrated.
 end note
else settled
 W --> Q: Acknowledge; duplicate settlement is no-op
end
note over U,G: Web/mobile booking screens currently use local mocks.\nThis diagram describes the backend API, not integrated client behavior.
@enduml
